<title>USA: Lexmark prices secondary offer.</title>
<headline>Lexmark prices secondary offer.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Ky. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lexmark International Group Inc said it priced its 10 million share secondary offer at $24.875 per share.</p>
<p>Lexmark said eight million shares are being sold in the United States with the rest sold in a concurrent international offering outside the U.S.</p>
<p>It said all 10 million shares are being offered by shareholders.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
